WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.570
- I'm here hanging out
with The Miz and Maryse.

00:00:02.570 --> 00:00:03.403
Give it up, woo hoo!

00:00:03.403 --> 00:00:05.760
(audience applauds and cheers)

00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:08.730
Do you know how they say
everything's bigger in Texas?

00:00:08.730 --> 00:00:10.260
If you don't then you're missing out

00:00:10.260 --> 00:00:11.093
'cause we're awesome.

00:00:11.093 --> 00:00:13.200
My next guest is living proof though.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:15.670
She's an interior designer
who does everything

00:00:15.670 --> 00:00:16.870
Texas size.

00:00:16.870 --> 00:00:19.520
Valentine's Day, look at that tree,

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:21.530
the 4th of July,

00:00:21.530 --> 00:00:25.813
Halloween, and of course, Christmas.

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:30.890
Though on most days you can
find her decorating Dallas

00:00:30.890 --> 00:00:33.050
but today she's Skyping in to help us

00:00:33.050 --> 00:00:34.860
with our own Christmas decor.

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:37.680
From Turtle Creek Lane let's
welcome Jennifer Houghton.

00:00:37.680 --> 00:00:39.181
How you doing?

00:00:39.181 --> 00:00:41.139
(audience applauds and cheers)

00:00:41.139 --> 00:00:42.860
- It's so good to see you.

00:00:42.860 --> 00:00:44.670
- It's good to see you again as well.

00:00:44.670 --> 00:00:45.790
First of all, I love your outfit.

00:00:45.790 --> 00:00:46.840
You're adorable.

00:00:46.840 --> 00:00:49.630
But Jennifer, you went
with the Nutcracker theme

00:00:49.630 --> 00:00:50.830
in your house this year, right?

00:00:50.830 --> 00:00:54.590
So how early did you have to
get started to do all of that?

00:00:54.590 --> 00:00:58.170
- So the minute Halloween goes
down, literally the next day,

00:00:58.170 --> 00:01:01.000
November 1st, all of Halloween goes out

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:03.110
and Christmas starts to go up.

00:01:03.110 --> 00:01:04.440
And yes you are right.

00:01:04.440 --> 00:01:06.530
We are doing the Nutcracker theme

00:01:06.530 --> 00:01:08.310
which means that every room

00:01:08.310 --> 00:01:10.950
in the house is going
to be a different scene

00:01:10.950 --> 00:01:12.980
from the Nutcracker ballet.

00:01:12.980 --> 00:01:14.070
- Oh, that's so cool.

00:01:14.070 --> 00:01:15.670
It's so creative.

00:01:15.670 --> 00:01:17.620
Do you guys, do y'all go
all out for Christmas?

00:01:17.620 --> 00:01:18.850
I know we were talking a little bit.

00:01:18.850 --> 00:01:19.683
- This is my nightmare

00:01:19.683 --> 00:01:20.846
right now, right now.
- And it's my favorite.

00:01:20.846 --> 00:01:21.679
My favorite.

00:01:21.679 --> 00:01:22.730
I love it by the way.

00:01:22.730 --> 00:01:23.830
This is awesome.

00:01:23.830 --> 00:01:25.209
- No, I completely disagree.
- I wanna tree

00:01:25.209 --> 00:01:26.470
in every single room.

00:01:26.470 --> 00:01:27.560
I love Christmas.

00:01:27.560 --> 00:01:29.180
- Look, look, all right, first off.

00:01:29.180 --> 00:01:32.410
Halloween ends and you don't
go straight to Christmas.

00:01:32.410 --> 00:01:33.243
- Yes you do.

00:01:33.243 --> 00:01:34.511
- There's Thanksgiving.

00:01:34.511 --> 00:01:35.344
Like,

00:01:35.344 --> 00:01:36.177
- It's the same thing.

00:01:36.177 --> 00:01:37.360
- I had to go up in the attic.

00:01:37.360 --> 00:01:39.346
I had to take all the
stuff down, build the tr-

00:01:39.346 --> 00:01:43.190
I have cuts on my
fingers still to this day

00:01:43.190 --> 00:01:45.260
from putting up Christmas stuff.

00:01:45.260 --> 00:01:47.514
- Somebody bring out some tissue.

00:01:47.514 --> 00:01:50.640
So Jennifer, explain what
you're showing us today.

00:01:50.640 --> 00:01:54.930
- Okay, so y'all are going
to be building a mantle

00:01:54.930 --> 00:01:57.290
and I know mantles can
be kind of intimidating

00:01:57.290 --> 00:01:59.680
but they're really not
if you just break them

00:01:59.680 --> 00:02:01.330
down into four easy steps.

00:02:01.330 --> 00:02:02.330
I'm gonna teach you the steps.

00:02:02.330 --> 00:02:03.163
- Okay.

00:02:03.163 --> 00:02:06.120
- First of all, get your garland right.

00:02:06.120 --> 00:02:09.980
Second, attach your ribbon correctly.

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:13.490
Third, pop in those hero
pieces that you've been dying

00:02:13.490 --> 00:02:14.930
to pull out of the attic

00:02:14.930 --> 00:02:17.670
and then fourth, sprinkle in some goodies

00:02:17.670 --> 00:02:19.420
and you're done.

00:02:19.420 --> 00:02:23.280
And Mike, since I know
you hate to decorate,

00:02:23.280 --> 00:02:24.700
I did you a little favor.

00:02:24.700 --> 00:02:29.090
I asked if we could have
your mantles almost completed

00:02:29.090 --> 00:02:31.150
but you do gotta do a
little bit of work with me.

00:02:31.150 --> 00:02:33.099
- That's done.
- That's not (laughs)

00:02:33.099 --> 00:02:34.021
- That looks done to me.

00:02:34.021 --> 00:02:34.854
(laughing)

00:02:34.854 --> 00:02:36.460
I love that she said

00:02:36.460 --> 00:02:38.830
and you get to go to the
attic, your favorite place.

00:02:38.830 --> 00:02:39.663
- Oh, my favorite place.

00:02:39.663 --> 00:02:40.620
(laughing)

00:02:40.620 --> 00:02:41.910
- That's amazing, okay.

00:02:41.910 --> 00:02:43.230
- So you're going to
take these hero pieces.

00:02:43.230 --> 00:02:45.710
I like to do ones that give me some height

00:02:45.710 --> 00:02:48.410
'cause on this mantle we're
doing like a mirrored image

00:02:48.410 --> 00:02:49.770
the left and the right.

00:02:49.770 --> 00:02:54.770
So just pop in those hero
pieces on either side over here.

00:02:56.430 --> 00:02:57.263
- Okay.

00:02:57.263 --> 00:02:58.096
- Oh yeah.

00:02:58.096 --> 00:02:59.720
- You have that beautiful height.

00:02:59.720 --> 00:03:00.553
- Mirror.

00:03:00.553 --> 00:03:02.998
- All our hero pieces are in place.

00:03:02.998 --> 00:03:04.310
(hands smacking)
- I gotta be honest with you.

00:03:04.310 --> 00:03:05.610
I like that it's a mirror image

00:03:05.610 --> 00:03:07.640
but I also liked how one was up top

00:03:07.640 --> 00:03:09.350
and one was kind of down by the fire.

00:03:09.350 --> 00:03:10.830
That was cool too.

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:11.969
- Yeah and you know what?

00:03:11.969 --> 00:03:15.400
You can do mantles a
hundred different ways.

00:03:15.400 --> 00:03:18.330
I just thought for Mike I'd
let him do it just simple.

00:03:18.330 --> 00:03:19.990
- Yeah, I liked the, I liked the symmetry.

00:03:19.990 --> 00:03:20.838
I'm into it.

00:03:20.838 --> 00:03:22.296
- Simple is better.

00:03:22.296 --> 00:03:23.970
(laughing)

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:24.803
- All right, well Jennifer,

00:03:24.803 --> 00:03:27.600
now onto the finishing touches right?

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:29.660
- Okay, yes, this is where
we have a lot of fun.

00:03:29.660 --> 00:03:33.500
This is where you go from
being amateur to a pro.

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:34.333
- I'm ready.

00:03:34.333 --> 00:03:36.250
- Okay, what we're gonna
do is we're gonna add,

00:03:36.250 --> 00:03:38.400
we're gonna sprinkle in our goodies.

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:42.020
I always love to add an
additional little swag

00:03:42.020 --> 00:03:44.010
and it's super easy to do.

00:03:44.010 --> 00:03:46.473
Add something there in the middle.

00:03:47.610 --> 00:03:48.510
- Shoot.

00:03:48.510 --> 00:03:51.290
- Attach it to another limb and wallah.

00:03:51.290 --> 00:03:52.897
How fabulous is that?

00:03:52.897 --> 00:03:53.960
(laughing)

00:03:53.960 --> 00:03:55.354
- I'm gonna just like
- How're we doing?.

00:03:55.354 --> 00:03:57.890
- Here, we gonna do this.

00:03:57.890 --> 00:03:59.650
Hold on, I got it.

00:03:59.650 --> 00:04:00.860
Hold on.

00:04:00.860 --> 00:04:03.380
I'm gonna shove it up in there.

00:04:03.380 --> 00:04:05.070
- You're doing great.

00:04:05.070 --> 00:04:05.903
- Thank you.

00:04:05.903 --> 00:04:07.570
- Yours looks like the
Christmas party after you,

00:04:07.570 --> 00:04:10.450
