after a Christmas party.

00:04:10.450 --> 00:04:13.210
It's like those, where you
had a really good time.

00:04:13.210 --> 00:04:14.880
I feel like my looks all right.

00:04:14.880 --> 00:04:16.850
Like it looks, you know, I don't know.

00:04:16.850 --> 00:04:17.683
And then I didn't have-

00:04:17.683 --> 00:04:19.453
