- I love decorating

00:04:22.185 --> 00:04:23.260
but I've never done that

00:04:23.260 --> 00:04:25.020
but you know, can we
put the little house on?

00:04:25.020 --> 00:04:26.130
Like all these little houses

00:04:26.130 --> 00:04:27.340
