- Yes yes.

00:04:27.340 --> 00:04:28.173
- Look at this.

00:04:28.173 --> 00:04:30.150
- So now comes the really fun.

00:04:30.150 --> 00:04:31.009
- Okay.

00:04:31.009 --> 00:04:31.842
- Now you take your ornaments.

00:04:31.842 --> 00:04:33.270
And what you always wanna do is start

00:04:33.270 --> 00:04:35.360
with your biggest ornaments first

00:04:35.360 --> 00:04:38.963
and just start placing those in.

00:04:40.190 --> 00:04:43.980
And you're gonna go from the
biggest down to the smallest.

00:04:43.980 --> 00:04:45.010
That's the trick

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:47.990
'cause then you get that
visual weight going on.

00:04:47.990 --> 00:04:50.040
- Okay, oh.

00:04:50.040 --> 00:04:52.283
- Add in those big pieces.

00:04:53.410 --> 00:04:54.243
